  "description": "<p class=\"RichTextEditor-module-editorParagraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span xss=removed>Nu te koop bij Used Products Amersfoort | met garantie:</span><br><br><strong><strong class=\"RichTextEditor-module-editorTextBold\" xss=removed>Dunlop Cry Baby GCB95 Standard Wah Pedaal</strong></strong><br><br><u><strong><strong class=\"RichTextEditor-module-editorTextBold RichTextEditor-module-editorTextUnderline\" xss=removed>Beschrijving:</strong></strong></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"RichTextEditor-module-editorParagraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span xss=removed>Klassiek wah pedaal voor elektrische gitaar met legendarisch Cry Baby geluid (Jimi Hendrix, Eric Clapton, Steve Vai en Joe Satriani)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"RichTextEditor-module-editorParagraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span xss=removed>Hot Potz 100 kOhm potentiometer voor dynamische, expressieve wah sweep</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"RichTextEditor-module-editorParagraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span xss=removed>Ideaal voor rock, funk, Blues en Classic metal</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"RichTextEditor-module-editorParagraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span xss=removed>Eenvoudige, intuïtieve bediening zonder extra schakelaars of menu's</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"RichTextEditor-module-editorParagraph\" dir=\"ltr\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"RichTextEditor-module-editorParagraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span xss=removed>Dit product is getest en functioneert volledig.</span><br><br><em><em class=\"RichTextEditor-module-editorTextItalic\" xss=removed>Garantie: 1 maand</em></em><br><br><strong><strong class=\"RichTextEditor-module-editorTextBold\" xss=removed>Bij ons: €79,99</strong></strong></p>",
